{
  "title": "Public Servers",
  "description": "Public REST servers other people run, each as `spell place ingest` wrote it, untouched, and each a page of its own.  GitHub:  a key named, never written, taken from the environment when it's set and gone without when it isn't;  lists that page by their Link header;  a rate limit read politely.  Open Library:  books found only by a search, refused at compile time without one;  each book's authors linked by their ids;  its covers on another server, each address built from the book's cover id.  JSONPlaceholder:  writes for real, adding, changing and deleting, each answered as if saved, and kept nowhere;  a post's comments read from the post's own address.  Open-Meteo:  a forecast asked for by a latitude and a longitude, refused at compile time without them;  its hours come as lists side by side, each hour read as one of each;  each measure in the unit the answer names, shown in the reader's own.  The Met Museum:  a list of over 500,000 ids, each artwork read whole from its own address only when it's drawn, a page at a time;  its search answers ids too, looking at all of each artwork;  its docs' pace, 80 requests a second, kept.  REST Countries:  every country in one request, with no paging;  its money, its languages and its names keyed by a code, each read as a list of things with that code",
  "imports": [{
    "path": "/GitHub.api.spell",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/GitHub.spellml",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/OpenLibrary.api.spell",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/OpenLibrary.spellml",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/JSONPlaceholder.api.spell",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/JSONPlaceholder.spellml",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/OpenMeteo.api.spell",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/OpenMeteo.spellml",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/MetMuseum.api.spell",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/MetMuseum.spellml",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/RestCountries.api.spell",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/RestCountries.spellml",
    "active": true
  }, {
    "path": "/PublicServers.spellml",
    "active": true
  }],
  "development": {
    "apis": [
      "GitHub.api.json5",
      "OpenLibrary.api.json5",
      "JSONPlaceholder.api.json5",
      "OpenMeteo.api.json5",
      "MetMuseum.api.json5",
      "RestCountries.api.json5"
    ]
  }
